{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Venture into the enigmatic depths of the Backrooms, As you delve deeper, uncover the mysteries of this sprawling network of interconnected spaces where reality frays at the seams. Some places are a hollow imitation of reality, some a terrifying display of chaos and despair... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are there not by luck</strong>, but you have a mission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do anything you must to survive in the ever terraforming world of backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO CONTENT </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo features a segment of the main story, played through the eyes of a single character. It offers an early look at the game\u2019s atmosphere, exploration, and survival mechanics while helping us gather player feedback to guide future development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms Interception has a unique take on the backrooms concept, with a lot of fan favorite levels as well as our original ones that flow with the game's dark story and gameplay. There are many choices to be made; <strong>this game is neither linear nor similar to most backrooms games</strong>, because it is its own cannon and doesn't conform to the rules of many. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to find any means necessary to survive in the twisted world of Backrooms Interception. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106690/extras/7e22ad3c954f9c3a87966a2072ec725d.poster.avif?t=1761865422\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106690/extras/7e22ad3c954f9c3a87966a2072ec725d.webm?t=1761865422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106690/extras/7e22ad3c954f9c3a87966a2072ec725d.mp4?t=1761865422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ITEMS AND INVENTORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This world isn't like ours; you will need to scrape anything you can find that can be helpful for your journey in this Dark and unforgiving world. This game won't lead you by hand you will have to learn what it takes to survive in this desolate illusion of reality. Work at your own pace. <strong>Food, Water, Materials, and Weapons are crucial for survival</strong>, only then can you worry about other things like getting out of there. From torches to backpacks, this game will have you making hard decisions on how you spend your resources.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Will you manage to survive?</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106690/extras/dce8a91b7c15be61efe248faefa2b797.poster.avif?t=1761865422\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106690/extras/dce8a91b7c15be61efe248faefa2b797.webm?t=1761865422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106690/extras/dce8a91b7c15be61efe248faefa2b797.mp4?t=1761865422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COMBAT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your survival is at stakes every second you spend inside backrooms, safe spaces are as rare as they can be, and <strong>you will need to rely on your skills in combat to survive even the smallest of threats as you navigate this world.</strong> At your disposal, you will have a lot of choices, <strong>from cold weapons like boards and axes to pistols and shotguns,</strong> that you might be able to get if you are skilled enough, are you? The entities here won't give you an easy time, they come in all shapes and sizes some are straight up nightmare fuel, while others are mimics of our world waiting for you to turn your back so they can strike.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Be aware and always keep your weapon ready...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106690/extras/b549a6ea616f5ed19b8b77ed339a0df2.poster.avif?t=1761865422\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106690/extras/b549a6ea616f5ed19b8b77ed339a0df2.webm?t=1761865422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106690/extras/b549a6ea616f5ed19b8b77ed339a0df2.mp4?t=1761865422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4106690?t=1761865422","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106690/a9a9cb0c257107a7cfe0d0f12dad462b17b77c8d/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761865422","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106690/d0f868d04d093424364492e86617d38cd02bf348/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761865422","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106690/d0f868d04d093424364492e86617d38cd02bf348/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761865422","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game contains mature content that may not be suitable for all audiences. Players can expect scenes involving violence, including killing and depictions of death through various means such as burning or other non-gory methods. While the game avoids excessive gore or graphic detail, it includes intense and frightening situations consistent with survival horror themes. "},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Venture into the enigmatic depths of the Backrooms, As you delve deeper, uncover the mysteries of this sprawling network of interconnected spaces where reality frays at the seams. Some places are a hollow imitation of reality, some a terrifying display of chaos and despair... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are there not by luck</strong>, but you have a mission. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do anything you must to survive in the ever terraforming world of backrooms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO CONTENT </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo features a segment of the main story, played through the eyes of a single character. It offers an early look at the game\u2019s atmosphere, exploration, and survival mechanics while helping us gather player feedback to guide future development. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backrooms Interception has a unique take on the backrooms concept, with a lot of fan favorite levels as well as our original ones that flow with the game's dark story and gameplay. There are many choices to be made; <strong>this game is neither linear nor similar to most backrooms games</strong>, because it is its own cannon and doesn't conform to the rules of many. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to find any means necessary to survive in the twisted world of Backrooms Interception. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st