oms, safe spaces are as rare as they can be, and <strong>you will need to rely on your skills in combat to survive even the smallest of threats as you navigate this world.</strong> At your disposal, you will have a lot of choices, <strong>from cold weapons like boards and axes to pistols and shotguns,</strong> that you might be able to get if you are skilled enough, are you? The entities here won't give you an easy time, they come in all shapes and sizes some are straight up nightmare fuel, while others are mimics of our world waiting for you to turn your back so they can strike.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Be aware and always keep your weapon ready...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106690/extras/b549a6ea616f5ed19b8b77ed339a0df2.poster.avif?t=1761865422\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106690/extras/b549a6ea616f5ed19b8b77ed339a0df2.webm?t=1761865422\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106690/extras/b549a6ea616f5ed19b8b77ed339a0df2.mp4?t=1761865422\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Giroshi Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2523460","name":"Backrooms Interception"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4106690/15ec6e225cf32bfd17171537af03744a92d1c00c/header.jpg?t=1761865422","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Copyright \u00a9 2025 Giroshi Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4106690/1835638080/a0d09454442d7e5ebfbc7a85c17c02ca136de3ec/1760